## Project location

The main application source code is inside:

```text
Cloud_inventory-main/
```

The full technical README is here:

```text
Cloud_inventory-main/README.md
```

That README includes more detail about the architecture, API routes, local setup, deployment notes, CI/CD, and demo reset scripts.

