---

## Status

The Stockwise-CRM upgrade has been developed and smoke-tested locally on a safe project copy and pushed to this separate GitHub repository for review.

Verified locally:

- Dashboard metrics and API health check
- Products page with unit price display and editing
- Customer Orders CRM workspace
- Product-based quote form with quantity, discount, delivery fee, and manual override
- CRM lead fields saved through the backend API
- Pipeline KPI cards linked through final estimated deal value
- Best-Selling Products scoped to the last 7 days
- Inventory and CRM demo reset scripts
- Backend API responses for products, leads, and CRM dashboard data

The original Stockwise production deployment was not modified by this CRM upgrade.
